  "$Comment": "Mob Battle training battleaxe fighter's combat, laid out like CAE_MobBattle_Dummy_Mace with the player's own iron battleaxe attacks. Basic = Root_Weapon_Battleaxe_Primary (down-left, down-right, down combo). Charged = Weapon_Battleaxe_Primary_Downstrike straight away (the player's 0.174 s tap-or-hold charge is skipped), ChargeFor 0.572 = its highest charge key. Signature = Root_Weapon_Battleaxe_Signature_Whirlwind, only picked with full SignatureEnergy (a held battleaxe raises its max to 9). Guard = Root_Weapon_Battleaxe_Secondary_Guard after taking damage. Every action carries Weapon_Battleaxe_Iron's interaction vars. Two-handed: no off hand. Kept distances: the role's MaintainDistance takes its range from each action's PostExecuteDistanceRange, so they all stay inside the basic attack's reach (strafe 2.5-4 kept it out of reach, staring at its rival); basic attack Timeout 0.5 lets it finish aiming instead of losing the try and waiting a cooldown.",
